  "patch_inventory": [
    "Private crate path remap to caller-owned ttf parser; exact archive original source identities retained in source_files.",
    "Explicit borrowed Context/ProviderResult propagation through selected GSUB/GPOS contextual, chained, ligature, reverse, pair, cursive and mark paths. None remains ordinary lookup nonmatch; Err aborts.",
    "ChargedVec exact-layout buffers, source groups, plan features, lookup/stage maps and coverage caches; no Face/cache cloning or heap plan Any.",
    "Explicit caller glyph/lookup limits; per-loop work and cancellation/epoch polling; metered normalization recursion and attachment/context recursion.",
    "Pre-delete source groups retain original global UTF8 clusters and surviving-glyph counts; standalone removed controls avoid neighbor attribution.",
    "Fixed 64-element context matching scratch and fixed three-tag language containers; no SmallVec spill. Inline language maximum63 bytes.",
    "Language static helper work precharged by source-derived LANGUAGE_MATCH_WORK_BOUND*63 and polled afterward; feature binary searches meter each comparison.",
    "Buffer range guards before extent subtraction; checked selected signed positioning and Arabic stretch arithmetic.",
    "Unsupported selected profile guards refuse outline fallback mark positioning and legacy/fallback kerning before those provider paths; unselected declarations pruned while derivative files preserved."
  ],
